{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1521.unity3d","item_key":"commands[3].text","source_sha256":"41f31af8c91d20b9e1bb73b31a4c395f1f64435155e30a4748ae2ad3bb80f40f","ja":"さらなる試練","zh":"更大的试炼","status":"accepted","updated_at":"2026-10-13T06:48:16+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1521.unity3d","item_key":"commands[4].text","source_sha256":"f21db1cde8c053bfd23c083902e7817925ce788e29e2c329fd842ce9a41c81a7","ja":"おやぶん以外で、しってそうな人……あっ！\nかおりとじゅりあは？","zh":"除了老大以外，可能会知道的人……啊！\n歌织和茱莉亚呢？","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T15:34:04+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1521.unity3d","item_key":"commands[5].text","source_sha256":"0d58e62df9f50b55a2a2bd2502974efb7dcfa20920106eec80c7565b96ef666b","ja":"そっか！　いっしょに打ち合わせするから、\nなにか聞いてるかも！","zh":"这样啊！　既然要一起开会，\n说不定听说了什么！","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T15:34:04+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1521.unity3d","item_key":"commands[6].text","source_sha256":"ec5081d4c129e1bdcb82ca3a1b0756a68819f468a36ae90d9dcfdd8235f746dd","ja":"プルルルル～……プルルルル～……。\nプルルルル～……プルルルル～…………","zh":"嘟噜噜噜～……嘟噜噜噜～……。\n嘟噜噜噜～……嘟噜噜噜～…………","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T15:34:04+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1521.unity3d","item_key":"commands[7].text","source_sha256":"c60076bd635d248e21e38a93e7400c9a77a8d448040876a2ce833e357d2979c5","ja":"……ふたりともお仕事中みたい。\n………………あっ！？","zh":"……两个人好像都在工作。\n………………啊！？","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T15:34:04+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1521.unity3d","item_key":"commands[8].text","source_sha256":"87faa73ac86e502dd70520f0250980a7f514827d34912b1de17ad0697f581236","ja":"ビュ～～～～～…………\nバサバサ～～……","zh":"呼呼呼～～～～～…………\n扑棱扑棱～～……","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T15:34:04+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1521.unity3d","item_key":"commands[11].text","source_sha256":"45b99df1cffe69c51f6a8c97a5cd58c385b8f98d171a585f2c375a76dd9b33b0","ja":"か、風でメモがとんでいっちゃったぞ～！？","zh":"风、风把便签给吹飞啦～！？","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T15:34:04+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1521.unity3d","item_key":"commands[12].text","source_sha256":"dc10a14c428e71dfdb3672ac70a15ad1d43ea8ffddf203ef070eeaa35099390c","ja":"だ、だ、大丈夫だよ、環ちゃん！\nふたりがおぼえてるところをあわせたら、きっと！","zh":"没、没、没问题的，小环！\n只要把我们两个记住的部分拼起来，就一定能！","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T15:34:04+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1521.unity3d","item_key":"commands[13].text","source_sha256":"442fb4bbcbb102c9858a475ed1d57c22c731e4a2a9ef4a2d13274ce40a1e5669","ja":"そっか！　育、頭いいぞ～。えっと、えーっと……\n着替えて……なんとかルームに集合って……。","zh":"这样啊！育真聪明～。呃，那个……\n换好衣服后……要集合在什么室来着……","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T15:34:04+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1521.unity3d","item_key":"commands[14].text","source_sha256":"17eea20241b624a16a29f9a52b4a82b74995b6f4b4decfc8bb60775812248b05","ja":"衣装に着替えるのかな？\nそれなら……レッスンルームに集合かも！","zh":"是要换上服装吗？\n那样的话……也许是在练习室集合！","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T15:34:04+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1521.unity3d","item_key":"commands[15].text","source_sha256":"b50e3e8b549b5b6db3f6b8444d5ffe5baa62ba7a7e50629e41aef82dea9d4157","ja":"あとは……マとクがつくものが書いてたよね？\nそれと、事務室がなんとかって……。","zh":"剩下的……写着带“马”和“库”的东西对吧？\n还有，事务所怎么来着……。","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T15:34:04+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1521.unity3d","item_key":"commands[16].text","source_sha256":"835c4b1bd4916bee398a7326217c15fc57fc2f2759a3dd534a2d514d24250908","ja":"それじゃあ、事務室を探険して、\nマとクがつくものをさがせばいいんだね！","zh":"那么，只要去探索办公室，\n找出名字里带有“マ”和“ク”的东西就行了吧！","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T15:34:04+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1521.unity3d","item_key":"commands[24].text","source_sha256":"ff84e9ae3abb7419b4b1f9328815d2405b7ac8f675db13c15ff78debcf9347f6","ja":"え～っと……これはゴミ箱で、\nこっちは台本で……マとクがつくもの……。","zh":"嗯～……这个是垃圾桶，\n这边是台本……带“马”和“克”的东西……","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T15:34:04+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1521.unity3d","item_key":"commands[25].text","source_sha256":"645b5bea6d5503a9b0da2a687a7349064b3ea9a25a179971200b5b659de0bd90","ja":"……あっ、きっとこれだぞ♪","zh":"……啊，肯定是这个♪","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T15:34:04+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1521.unity3d","item_key":"commands[26].text","source_sha256":"226470ce6136cc3ba281f0b19768b9c877bf28d070107968a30f358a3cfc82a1","ja":"それって、美希さんが、おひるねにつかってる\nマクラ？　それであってるのかな……？","zh":"那个是美希小姐午睡时用的\n枕头吗？是那个对吧……？","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T15:34:04+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1521.unity3d","item_key":"commands[27].text","source_sha256":"0629e281a24565f1c6007673a78b9127c8b8e063d152e3ffa979b953274f30b6","ja":"でも、他に見つからないし、持って行こっか。","zh":"不过既然找不到别的，就带这个去吧。","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T15:34:04+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1521.unity3d","item_key":"commands[28].text","source_sha256":"5e88d1a6007e305d07cc775c65150cda731394e26b5c6b61f1948b863184d8a4","ja":"うん！　あとは、衣装に着替えて……。","zh":"嗯！接下来只要换上服装就……。","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T15:34:04+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1521.unity3d","item_key":"commands[29].text","source_sha256":"e23fcf1b22252b31882d61d284155b7365c49d41fdb2df570a93d5bc0a4d4fea","ja":"……あっ、環ちゃん！　もうこんな時間だよ！","zh":"……啊，小环！已经这个时间了！","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T15:34:04+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1521.unity3d","item_key":"commands[30].text","source_sha256":"37801d4fa375fa99bd5df31e41ca8abacb642e3808e22611c208c73996c648f4","ja":"あれっ？　うちあわせって、2時だっけ？","zh":"咦？碰头开会是2点来着吗？","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T15:34:04+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1521.unity3d","item_key":"commands[31].text","source_sha256":"67e12aaa2d54da890abb96242c5aeb2c1c65aaef0536f97dfe21b0afe1da7379","ja":"たしか、14時って書いてたと思うよ！\nだから急いで着替えないと。いこっ！","zh":"我记得好像写的是14点哦！\n所以得赶快换衣服才行。走吧！","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T15:34:04+00:00"}
